#: includes/Admin/Labels.php:55
msgid "Connection cancelled."
msgstr "تم إلغاء الربط."

#: includes/Admin/Labels.php:56
msgid "Your site address and your WordPress admin address differ (domain, http/https or port), so Tassyir cannot connect. Make them match (Settings → General) and try again."
