#: includes/Admin/Notices.php:50
msgid "Tassyir for WooCommerce needs WooCommerce 8.0 or newer. Please install and activate WooCommerce; until then the plugin does nothing."
msgstr "تحتاج إضافة Tassyir for WooCommerce إلى WooCommerce 8.0 أو أحدث. يرجى تثبيت WooCommerce وتفعيله؛ حتى ذلك الحين لا تقوم الإضافة بأي شيء."

#: includes/Admin/Notices.php:67
msgid "Tassyir: this site must be reconnected. Orders are kept in the queue until then."
